--- !u!114 &5260419259995449805
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8716915309515516289}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b72b968ab35b7747863b866328637d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizManagerArun
  questions:
  - questionText: 1,Where did Tenali Raman chant the Mantra?
    option1: In the Kali Temple.
    option2: Underwater
    option3: In his house.
    option4: In front of the T.V.
    option1IsCorrect: 1
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ef41fd9b3c04e442bf0732a7e7821fe, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 038fc7603ffb92148afc10d03962b637, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: "2,Raman\u2019s desire was to.."
    option1: Compose more puranas.
    option2: "Impress King Krishnadevraya and become part of the King\u2019s durbar."
    option3: Defeat King Krishnadevaraya and become the king himself.
    option4: Earn money and invest in the stock market
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d16581ade0842344db9132ce403611be, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 9cef9a4a561ac8f42b3f08a80e3cda9a, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 8
  - questionText: 3,Who was Tathacharya?
    option1: Son of King Krishnadevaraya
    option2: Durbar priest of the Vijayanagra empire
    option3: Father of King Krishnadevaraya.
    option4: "Kali Devi\u2019s temple priest."
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c09526a6b06cae34b9212a0540678c92, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 2039fa9de2ade6642becf9a78fb06d6f, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 5
  - questionText: 4,When Tenali Raman saw Tathacharya in the Kali Temple he wanted
      to...
    option1: Impress Thathachary.
    option2: Beat Thathachary.
    option3: Celebrate Krishna Jayanti with Thathachary.
    option4: Debate Thathachary.
    option1IsCorrect: 1
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73e83f4d9c2821a4888d70dc5670d33c, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 728d8a3c87a381d4c8a16db51ed787ad, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: "5,What did Tathacharya think after seeing Raman\u2019s Lingapurana?"
    option1: He must have copied it from somewhwere
    option2: "If Tenai Raman became part of King\u2019s durbar, I can listen to the
      Lingaprana everyday."
    option3: The Lingapurana is so boring.
    option4: "If Tenali Raman became part of King\u2019s durbar, my fame and reputation
      will be at risk."
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8987babc212932b4989bc30833516d7c, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 11847a93d7425c04fad682bb14f9c932, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: 6,Why did Tathachary hire Raman?
    option1: To make him do all his household chores.
    option2: "To keep Raman close to him, so that he won\u2019t go to durbar."
    option3: "To curtian Raman\u2019s ability to prosper."
    option4: To learn magic tricks from Tenali Raman.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a815a959e36b1cb4d83e284b903ddd0a, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: da303c7ddc627fd44b9fc35d08ff80ee, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 5
  - questionText: 7,What did Tathacharya promise Raman before leaving  for Vijayanagara?
    option1: He will send money every month in a royal bag.
    option2: He would send sweets and snacks signed by the king himself.
    option3: He would come back the following week and bring the king with him.
    option4: Once he settled down, he would invite Tenali Raman and have him meet
      the King.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06ce5d23850d6bd4f83a0a91d8f6f370, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: ed2ebc8889acb2641b3091ca9d243b46, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: 8,After waiting a long time for an invite from Tathacharya, what
      did Raman do ?
    option1: He went back to his hometown and became a farmer.
    option2: He started a business in Managalagrir.
    option3: He left fror Vijayanagaram with his family.
    option4: He thought that he could wait a little while longer.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 065959aeea33c1c4d8e5dd478a0b1186, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 9081b293a2d2e9d40ac444fd789c11a5, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 5
  - questionText: 9,When Raman went to Thatacharya house, what did Tahathacarya do
      ?
    option1: He tool Tenali to see a movie.
    option2: He cooked Rasam for Tenali Raman.
    option3: He welcomed Tenali Raman and gave him sweets.
    option4: He pretended to not know Tenali Raman.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5c37b08683e5e340aa6461e1e0299a6, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 40a99460cba97d44b9562934e3ab9af7, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 5
  - questionText: 10,What happened when Tenali Raman realized that he was cheated
      ?
    option1: Tenali Raman felt miserable.
    option2: Tenali Raman vowed to teach Tathachary a lesson.
    option3: Tenali Raman went on a long drive.
    option4: Tenali Raman started crying.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f538a75036968d42817b6f418eeb778, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: c4a41d1017676c74f931d5b6a3210f41, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
